  "changes": [
    "load the target project's .claude/settings.json and settings.local.json hooks at session start (snapshot)",
    "native runs lifecycle and native-tool hooks; CLAUDE_CODE_SHELL_PREFIX routes registered commands to hook-proxy.mjs, which runs them on the target; exec form is converted to a quoted shell form run as argv",
    "context-mod reproduces PreToolUse, PostToolUse, PostToolUseFailure and PermissionRequest for facade-routed target tools, including async hooks, base input fields, agent_id/agent_type, transcript copies and CLAUDE_ENV_FILE",
    "a non-zero foreground Bash exit is a tool error 'Exit code N' + output, as natively (3.6.0 reported success with a trailing 'Exit code: N')",
    "PermissionRequest hooks race a pending host prompt; a decision withdraws it through the new bridge /withdraw endpoint",
    "tool hooks the adapter cannot reproduce (prompt/http/agent/mcp types, if, asyncRewake) refuse matching calls before any effect"
  ],
